{"batchcomplete":true,"query":{"pages":[{"pageid":577248,"ns":0,"title":"New riddle of induction","extract":"The new riddle of induction was presented by Nelson Goodman in Fact, Fiction, and Forecast as a successor to Hume's original problem. It presents the logical predicates grue and bleen which are unusual due to their time-dependence.","description":"Philosophical paradox introduced by Nelson Goodman","descriptionsource":"local"}]}}